She even said you're a little crybaby.

587
00:41:05,040 --> 00:41:06,040
Why do you cry so much?

588
00:41:08,240 --> 00:41:09,880
The world's judgment is frightening.

589
00:41:12,600 --> 00:41:14,200
I wonder if Zhen Xin and Zhang Zhun

590
00:41:15,720 --> 00:41:16,960
will be blessed in the end.

591
00:41:18,040 --> 00:41:19,480
The world's judgment is frightening.

592
00:41:21,920 --> 00:41:23,440
But you and I holding hands to the end

593
00:41:24,200 --> 00:41:25,480
isn't that our story?

594
00:41:35,600 --> 00:41:36,999
(On behalf of the entire cast and crew, I would like to extend our most sincere gratitude to
every member of the audience who has accompanied and supported "Deep in" during this time.)

595
00:41:37,000 --> 00:41:38,000
(May you always maintain the courage to pursue what you love. We
are, after all, capable of living our lives in any way we choose.)

596
00:41:38,001 --> 00:41:40,121
(Be bold to become,
to pursue, and to love. - Wen Dao)
